Z||000005||Monkeyman||02-27-2000||01:51 PM||||Rodney has been here for a while.  It was just recently that he actually registered and started talking to us.  (Correct me if I'm wrong, Rodney.)<P>Rodney--I wish I'd know about those bumpers sooner.  I just rebuilt my motors with donated parts (thanx Mr. anonymous!).  I could have used the bumpers.  Are your gears alloy or nylon?||||reg||1
